Online Personalized Fitness Class Booking Platform
Develop a platform for booking personalized fitness classes with features for class
scheduling, trainer profiles, and booking management. Implement tools for providing
class recommendations, offering trainer feedback, and facilitating payment
processing to support fitness booking.
What to do?
Class Scheduling:
● Implement a scheduling system for fitness classes, allowing users to view
available class times and book sessions with trainers.
● Include options for users to filter classes based on type (e.g., yoga, strength
training, cardio), duration, and time slots.
● Provide features for trainers to set their availability and manage their
schedules.
Trainer Profiles:
● Create detailed profiles for fitness trainers, including information such as
qualifications, expertise, and areas of specialization.
● Allow trainers to upload photos, videos, and introductory messages to attract
potential clients.
● Include user reviews and rating
Booking Management:
● Implement a booking system that allows users to reserve and manage fitness
class sessions. Provide options for users to view, reschedule, or cancel
bookings.
● Send email or SMS notifications to users for booking confirmations,
reminders, and changes.
● Allow trainers to manage their bookings and view their class schedules.
Class Recommendations:
● Develop a recommendation system that suggests classes based on user
preferences, past bookings, and fitness goals.
● Include personalized recommendations for users to discover new classes and
trainers that match their interests.
Trainer Feedback:
● Provide a feedback mechanism for users to rate and review trainers after
completing a class.
● Implement features for trainers to respond to feedback and improve their
services based on user input.
Payment Processing:
● Integrate a secure payment gateway to handle class bookings and
transactions.
● Provide users with a smooth checkout experience and send payment
confirmations via email.
User Features:
● Implement secure user registration and login functionalities. Allow users to
manage their profiles, fitness goals, and preferences.
● Provide a user dashboard to view upcoming classes, booking history, and
class recommendations.
● Include features for searching and filtering classes, viewing trainer profiles,
and managing bookings.
Techstacks needs to be used:
● MERN stack
● TailwindCSS for styling
● Payment gateway integration
How do I submit my work?
● Deploy your web application using Netlify (https://www.netlify.com), Render
(https://www.render.com).
● Push all your work files to GitHub.
● Submit your URLs in the portal.
